  hints:
  - 'My passion can be seen but cannot be preserved. This is part of every life from
    the beginning to the very end, whether I am liquid or solid.  '
  - I was once who I was. Now I still am. And I always will be.
  - 'When everyone looked toward us, I spoke so they could work '
  - 'Emotions are probably important, but not during work. '
  - 'Breakfast, work, dinner, sleep. Repeat. '
